        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Open Range (1927 film)\n- People: Clifford Smith, Roy Briant, Zane Grey, J. Walter Ruben, John Stone\n- Topics: Lost films, silent films, film and television adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Open Range is a lost 1927 American Western silent film.\n- Clifford Smith directed Open Range.\n- Roy Briant, Zane Grey, J. Walter Ruben, and John Stone wrote Open Range.\n- Zane Grey's novels and short stories were adapted into 112 films, two television episodes, and the television series \"Dick Powell's Zane Grey Theater.\"",
